      "source": [
        "# Curtin ICS-SimLab Intrusion Detection System\n",
        "This notebook contains the code for building an Intrusion Detection System from data collected from Industrial Control System simulations developed with ICS-SimLab. The GitHub repository for ICS-SimLab is found here: https://github.com/JaxsonBrownie/ICS-SimLab."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "CcyWKVcOBmns"
      },
      "source": [
        "## Datasets\n",
        "We first import the 3 datasets into 3 dataframes from a Google drive. The datasets are described as follows:\n",
        "1. `dataset_ied_packet.csv` - Packet data collected from the Intelligent Electronic Device Substation simulation.\n",
        "2. `dataset_smart_grid_packet.csv` - Packet data collected from the Smart Electrical Grid simulation.\n",
        "3. `dataset_water_factory_packet.csv` - Packet data collected from the Water Bottle Filling Factory simulation.\n",
        "\n",
        "All simulations are developed with the Curtin ICS-SimLab software, which can be found at https://github.com/JaxsonBrownie/ICS-SimLab."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "from google.colab import drive\n",
        "drive.mount('/content/drive')"
