            "LLM Output:  Flow: Modbus 43 at 12 pps is under the 15 pps anomaly threshold. Packet size and timing fit normal diagnostics. No DoS or fuzzing indicators. Behavior consistent with standard ICS polling. Risk Score: 2/10\n",
