            "Total tokens used: {'input_tokens': 231, 'input_tokens_details': {'cache_write_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0}, 'output_tokens': 955, 'output_tokens_details': {'reasoning_tokens': 832}, 'total_tokens': 1186}\n",
            "LLM Output:  Source 192.168.0.1 is issuing Modbus diagnostic (func code 8) requests to 192.168.0.31 at 17 pps, exceeding normal flow. This suggests scanning or probing the ICS. Risk Score: 5/10\n",
            "====================================================\n",
            "7\n",
