            "Total tokens used: {'input_tokens': 252, 'input_tokens_details': {'cache_write_tokens': 0, 'cached_tokens': 0}, 'output_tokens': 1248, 'output_tokens_details': {'reasoning_tokens': 1152}, 'total_tokens': 1500}\n",
            "LLM Output:  Modbus traffic from 192.168.0.31 to .1 at 12.25 pps is below the 15.07 pps anomaly threshold. Function code 8 diagnostic request appears routine, with normal RTT and in‐flight bytes. No flooding or exploitation signature detected. Risk Score: 2/10\n",
            "====================================================\n",
